iture spent on the property. He stated that D500,000 will be fair compensation for him.', 'Y', '2023-06-22', 'Y', 'In Person', 'Y', 'Not applicable', 'Closed.', '2025-04-28 13:59:07.4026940 ', 20009, 21, 'D309& D6530 -GM', 'GERMP T&D'), ('GR-TL145', 'F', '2023-06-07', 'Nuha Colley', 'Letter', 'Nafisatou Gassama C/O Shering Ahmad Fadera', '7629017', 'Nafisatou in a letter dated 12/04/2023 received at the PIU on 25/05/2023 claimed she bought three years ago for more than what she is been offered for compensation. She stated that D505,000 will be fair compensation to her.', 'Y', '2023-06-23', 'Y', 'In Person', 'Y', 'Not applicable', 'Closed.', '2025-04-28 14:10:10.4651390 ', 20009, 21, 'D309& D6530 -GM', 'GERMP T&D');